---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A bit about me: Huzaif Shaikh, ISE student at the University of Limerick."
	pubDate={new Date('October 21 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Huzaif. I'm originally from Pakistan and I'm now studying Immersive Software
		Engineering (ISE) at the University of Limerick.
	</p>

	<p>
		I chose ISE because it looked like a very intersting course and the job oppurtunities are great.
	</p>

	<p>
		Outside of college, soccer is my main hobby. I play for the UL Wolves freshers team and for
		Avenue United in Ennis. You can read more on my <a href="/soccer">soccer page</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>About this site</h2>
	<p>
		This website is my project for CS4421 DevOps. It's built with Astro and every change goes
		through a full pipeline: code is checked by linting, type checks and unit tests in GitHub
		Actions, and once merged it's deployed automatically to AWS (S3 and CloudFront) using
		infrastructure written as code with the AWS CDK.
	</p>
</Layout>